abstract: >-
  Open specification, executable zero-dependency verification tools, bilingual
  handbooks (EN/DE), and critique-correction catalog (ai0S-FAQ) for human-in-command
  AI safety (PID 1 human origin and veto, 99/1 local-vs-cloud Leased Memory,
  Negative-Shape outer boundaries, AXIOM_TEST, 4-layer onion weight architecture,
  two-sided compass orientation in Doors 1-4, and dual-address Ring B accountability).
  Anchored via OpenTimestamps in the Bitcoin blockchain (starting at block 971315)
  and signed with Ed25519 (9F4D9A266D720FE6336574D87B410637560297CF).
